{"3443630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animal Cafe", "steam_appid": 3443630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Animal Cafe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in a magical forest, you play as a tiny animal chef serving cozy meals to woodland guests. Cook, serve, and create a warm haven for all who wander in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/4c12f2646abfcc7d7142d6e212ed9549.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/4c12f2646abfcc7d7142d6e212ed9549.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/4c12f2646abfcc7d7142d6e212ed9549.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choose your cards and build unique culinary styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly 200 specialty food cards from around the world, create diverse cooking strategies to boost customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/153f6615c2baab84c52860ef687d236c.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/153f6615c2baab84c52860ef687d236c.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/153f6615c2baab84c52860ef687d236c.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect matching food cards to trigger bonus rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards with similar flavors and ingredients can be linked together to earn extra satisfaction — experiment to discover more combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e51e3b587e189ab5fd8a57a8e1e89757.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e51e3b587e189ab5fd8a57a8e1e89757.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e51e3b587e189ab5fd8a57a8e1e89757.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair your dishes with cookware and sauces to unlock even more combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different kitchen tools enhance card effects, while sauces let you tweak flavors — giving you endless possibilities in your culinary journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/f920839dff25e2d11fb37d99b4857b0b.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/f920839dff25e2d11fb37d99b4857b0b.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/f920839dff25e2d11fb37d99b4857b0b.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve guests with diverse tastes and meet more adorable animal friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make new friendships through food — welcome to Animal Cafe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Animal Cafe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in a magical forest, you play as a tiny animal chef serving cozy meals to woodland guests. Cook, serve, and create a warm haven for all who wander in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/4c12f2646abfcc7d7142d6e212ed9549.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/4c12f2646abfcc7d7142d6e212ed9549.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/4c12f2646abfcc7d7142d6e212ed9549.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choose your cards and build unique culinary styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly 200 specialty food cards from around the world, create diverse cooking strategies to boost customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/153f6615c2baab84c52860ef687d236c.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/153f6615c2baab84c52860ef687d236c.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/153f6615c2baab84c52860ef687d236c.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect matching food cards to trigger bonus rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards with similar flavors and ingredients can be linked together to earn extra satisfaction — experiment to discover more combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e51e3b587e189ab5fd8a57a8e1e89757.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e51e3b587e189ab5fd8a57a8e1e89757.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e51e3b587e189ab5fd8a57a8e1e89757.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair your dishes with cookware and sauces to unlock even more combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different kitchen tools enhance card effects, while sauces let you tweak flavors — giving you endless possibilities in your culinary journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/f920839dff25e2d11fb37d99b4857b0b.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/f920839dff25e2d11fb37d99b4857b0b.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/f920839dff25e2d11fb37d99b4857b0b.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve guests with diverse tastes and meet more adorable animal friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make new friendships through food — welcome to Animal Cafe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.poster.avif?t=1762400307\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.webm?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.mp4?t=1762400307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\